WEBVTT

00:00:00.102 --> 00:00:05.954
Now we are starting the coding exercises for
Assignment 5 In Exercise

00:00:05.980 --> 00:00:09.266
1 you need to return patients who are either age
sixty-five or

00:00:09.292 --> 00:00:13.106
older or have Kidney Disease but explicit consent
must apply to the

00:00:13.119 --> 00:00:18.829
entire rule The key idea is grouping Put the age and
diagnosis

00:00:18.855 --> 00:00:26.251
alternatives inside parentheses Then add the consent
requirement with AND You

00:00:26.264 --> 00:00:30.389
can write the SQL directly in the browser When you
are ready

00:00:30.608 --> 00:00:35.969
select Run and Check The browser will test your
answer Your work

00:00:35.982 --> 00:00:41.260
is saved locally in this browser If you prefer
working in pgAdmin

00:00:41.454 --> 00:00:44.508
you can also copy the starter query finish it in the
Query

00:00:44.534 --> 00:00:47.845
Tool test it there and then bring your completed SQL
back to

00:00:47.871 --> 00:00:52.267
the browser for checking Focus on the logic before
the syntax
